/-!
# Small certificates for M22 cocode fixed codimension

For each nonidentity quadratic pair in the native setwise-pair Sylow group,
five columns of its two quotient displacement maps have a left inverse.
The quotient is the literal cocode modulo the marked pair line. All identities
are checked in the companion module against the existing native matrices.
Source: Aschbacher–Smith, K.4.4, printed p.459.
-/
